# promise: #491
# An imported extension the Web Store won't install (delisted, or its store version asks for more than the copy)
# was asked for again at the first page of every launch. Each ask downloads its CRX, which showed as a file on Cra's
# Dock icon and over the sidebar's downloads every day (GitHub #491, 19 Nov 2026: "every time I close and reopen
# Cra"). Once the store has said no in a profile, the extension stays the imported copy there and later launches
# don't ask; importing it again clears that. Here the store answers 404, and the relaunch's first page asks nothing.
budget rss=700
extension ${FIXTURES}/WebStoreCopy/${WEB_STORE_COPY_ID}
arg --apps-gallery-download-url=${ORIGIN}/missing/%s.crx
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=store
expect-log extension ${WEB_STORE_COPY_ID}: installing from the Web Store in Default
expect-log GET /missing/
expect-log Web Store install in Default failed
wait 1
relaunch
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=relaunched
expect-log GET /page.html\?n=relaunched
wait 3
expect-log extension ${WEB_STORE_COPY_ID}: the Web Store refused it in Default before; it stays the imported copy there
